<title>USA: Genetic Vector sees no reason for shr drop.</title>
<headline>Genetic Vector sees no reason for shr drop.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genetic Vectors Inc said on Wednesday that it is unaware of any developments that would explain the recent decline in its share price.</p>
<p>Genetic Vectors shares fell 3/8 to 5-3/4 on 18,600 shares of volume.  The company's shares had a 52-week high of 18-1/2 and a low of 4-3/4.</p>
